{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And the gold of the wave-offering.</b> So called because the one who donates it waves it, lifting it up and down when he gives it to the treasurer — it is called a wave-offering." "<b>Talents, twenty-nine, etc.</b> If you examine it well, you will find that the total gold for all the work of the Tabernacle comes to one thousand four hundred fifty-six litrin and twenty pashitim of beaten gold."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {1 "The verse's total (29 talents + 730 shekels) is converted here into medieval units of litrin and pashitim; the verse continuation 'וגו׳' absorbs the remaining words of the verse."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:09.666549504Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}